{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52930","headline":"送贺秘监归会稽诗 · 严向","name":"送贺秘监归会稽诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤云去住本无机，却指苍梧下翠微。\n锡鼎爲传仙族在，泛槎还入海烟归。\n客星一夜淩光武，华表千年送令威。\n闻道葛洪丹竈畔，至今霜果有金衣。\n（见《会稽掇英总集》卷二）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"严向","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52930.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52930","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}